+# Wire Format Policy
+
+No current decision is recorded in this project's documentation or history designating a single wire serialisation format; the codebase provides general-purpose support for multiple formats (including JSON, XML, YAML, TOML, protobuf, and msgpack) as interchangeable rendering and binding options rather than as evidence of an adopted policy.
